  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Herbalist level 10th</p>\n<p>It may only be a glimpse of your true potential, but that glimpse is potent nonetheless.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain limited access to the abilities normally wielded only by herbalists of tremendous power. Choose one of the following natural prodigy capstone options, but only if you would have access to it at 20th level. (Many capstone options are unique to particular archetypes.) You may use the chosen ability once per day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A rock is a rock (1d8 damage per herbalist level)</li>\n<li>Master lepidopterist</li>\n<li>Netter extraordinaire</li>\n<li>Rapid placer</li>\n<li>Reinvigorating rocks</li>\n<li>Sapient plants</li>\n<li>Toxic thumb</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
